+ * SWEET Adreno 618 bring-up.  Stage 1 (sweetgpu=1) is a read-only GPUCC and
+ * command-DB audit.  Stage 2 (sweetgpu=2) additionally votes the three ARC
+ * rails; it still performs no GPUCC power, clock, reset, firmware or GPU
+ * aperture writes.  ARC voting is the prerequisite for every later stage.
